# Cloud deploy & database ops

When running as a **Cursor Cloud Agent** on this repo:

1. Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and [`docs/cloud-agent-setup.md`](../../docs/cloud-agent-setup.md).
2. Run `npm run ops:verify-cloud` before migrations or deploys.
3. Apply SQL via `npm run db:link:ci` then `npm run db:push` (never paste secrets into files).
4. Production deploy: merge to **`main`** (Vercel auto-deploy). Use `npm run ops:vercel:deploy` only as fallback.
5. New `public` tables in migrations must include GRANT + RLS per `supabase/migrations/README.md`.
